--
N5008 [over.ics.list]/6 + [dcl.init.list]/3.4: a braced-init-list converts to a
reference to an array of known bound when it fits and every element converts;
the temporary array is what the reference binds to ([dcl.init.ref]/5.4.2).
Also covers `{T{}}' -- a compound literal element type-checked a second time
when the call's arguments are converted.
